license: MIT
abstract: >-
  MohandesYar AI 2.0 is an offline-first Persian progressive web application
  for civil engineering field documentation. It stores original image and
  video evidence locally in IndexedDB, records optional geolocation and
  SHA-256 integrity metadata, supports backup and restore, and generates
  multi-page Persian A4 reports.
keywords:
  - civil engineering
  - field documentation
  - progressive web application
  - offline-first
  - Persian RTL
  - IndexedDB
  - SHA-256
  - geolocation
  - evidence integrity
